<h2 style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(34px, 4.4vw, 56px); line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -0.04em; color: #0F1A2E">One box, many boxes, or none yet.</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; color: #334055">The same services scale from a single Compose file to a multi-host cell. The state model doesn’t change: hosts only ever apply signed desired state.</p>
