<h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #0F1A2E">Standalone</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #4B5568"><code style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 13.5px">docker compose up</code> runs the whole stack on one machine. <code style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 13.5px">vrt-local</code> is the management plane; the <code style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 13.5px">vrt</code> CLI deploys, rolls back and manages secrets.</p>
</div>
</article>

