<div style="padding: 22px 24px 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #0F1A2E">Multi-host cell</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #4B5568"><code style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 13.5px">cell-controller</code> owns cron, queues, leases and tenant assignment across many <code style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 13.5px">vrt-host</code> machines, and publishes signed desired state to each.</p>
</div>
</article>

<article style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; border: 1px solid #D5DAE3; border-radius: 16px; background: #FFFFFF; overflow: hidden">
